    "sections": {
        "description": "Unhurried is a calm, editorial block theme for studios, clinics, spas and makers who sell care rather than speed. Warm bone and ink surfaces, floating panels that rise over the page, oversized display type with Fraunces italic accent words, and a gallery-monochrome image treatment give every page the feel of a printed lookbook. It ships with full-page patterns for a homepage, about, services and contact page, plus heroes, visit steps, service accordions, membership tiers, FAQs and a stories layout, all editable in the Site Editor."
    },
